#: ../../../rest/db-browse-get.rst:2
msgid "GET /rest/db/browse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-browse-get.rst:4
msgid ""
"Returns the directory tree of the global model. Directories are always JSON "
"objects (map/dictionary), and files are always arrays of modification time "
"and size. The first integer is the files modification time, and the second "
"integer is the file size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-browse-get.rst:9
msgid ""
"The call takes one mandatory ``folder`` parameter and two optional "
"parameters. Optional parameter ``levels`` defines how deep within the tree "
"we want to dwell down (0 based, defaults to unlimited depth) Optional "
"parameter ``prefix`` defines a prefix within the tree where to start "
"building the structure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-browse-get.rst:15
msgid ""
"$ curl -s http://localhost:8384/rest/db/browse?folder=default | json_pp\n"
"{\n"
"   \"directory\": {\n"
"      \"file\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928],\n"
"      \"subdirectory\": {\n"
"         \"another file\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928]\n"
"      }\n"
"   },\n"
"   \"rootfile\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$ curl -s http://localhost:8384/rest/db/browse?folder=default&levels=0 | "
"json_pp\n"
"{\n"
"   \"directory\": {},\n"
"   \"rootfile\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$ curl -s http://localhost:8384/rest/db/browse?folder=default&levels=1 | "
"json_pp\n"
"{\n"
"   \"directory\": {\n"
"      \"file\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928],\n"
"      \"subdirectory\": {}\n"
"   },\n"
"   \"rootfile\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$ curl -s http://localhost:8384/rest/db/browse?"
"folder=default&prefix=directory/subdirectory | json_pp\n"
"{\n"
"   \"another file\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$ curl -s http://localhost:8384/rest/db/browse?"
"folder=default&prefix=directory&levels=0 | json_pp\n"
"{\n"
"   \"file\": [\"2015-04-20T22:20:45+09:00\", 130940928],\n"
"   \"subdirectory\": {}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/db-browse-get.rst:55
msgid ""
"This is an expensive call, increasing CPU and RAM usage on the device. Use "
"sparingly."
msgstr ""
